      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this change mostly improves things, but overall, we still have a strange situation where most perm checks happen in `RefControl`, but then the ones that need commit object data have their logic in `CommitValidator`s. It feels weird to have that logic outside of the `permissions` package.",
